    {"id": "L3-022", "topic": "me", "emoji": "🚀", "word": "What do you want to be?", "zh": "你长大想做什么？", "fact": "被问长大想做什么，就回答 I want to be a scientist. 或者 I want to be an astronaut.", "quiz": {"type": "choice", "q": "别人问 What do you want to be?，你回答？", "options": ["I want to be a doctor.", "I want to be ten.", "I want a doctor."]}},
