    {"id": "L3-024", "topic": "me", "emoji": "🔁", "word": "How often do you play football?", "zh": "你多久踢一次足球？", "fact": "问多久一次用 How often...?，回答 Every day. 或 Twice a week.", "quiz": {"type": "choice", "q": "How often do you play football? 最好的回答是？", "options": ["Twice a week.", "Two balls.", "At the park."]}},
